# Repo split (#952): apps/web/ is gone from this repo (CI refuses it). The experiments' harnesses
# lay the pinned noevia-core out there locally (docs/repo-split-cutover.md), and `make assemble`
# writes release trees to out/; neither is ever committed.
/apps/web/
/out/

# Atomic fresh-install environment staging.
.env.fresh.*
qa-shots/
local-test/
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
# The permission allowlist is shared on purpose: every session here runs the
# same test/typecheck/build commands, and prompting for them each time is noise.
!.claude/settings.json

# Framing eval reports (experiments/framing-eval)
/experiments/framing-eval/results/
